      "distinction": "Arrow Clubtails are distinguished from their Zebra Clubtail cousins by the arrow marking versus zebra-like stripes, and from Riverine Clubtails by their preference for larger streams rather than small headwater brooks."
    },
    {
      "slug": "stylurus-scudderi",
